{"id":"n14365-1-7","stage":2,"title":"대형 · 大型","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14365-1-7-1","ko":"우리 가족은 할머니, 할아버지, 삼촌, 이모와 한집에 살고 있어.","zh":"我们家和奶奶、爷爷、叔叔、姨妈住在一起。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가족은","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할머니,","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할아버지,","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"삼촌,","meaning":"叔叔，舅舅","explanation":"삼촌：叔叔，舅舅","readings":[{"term":"삼촌","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61142","senseId":"1","lemma":"삼촌","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이모와","meaning":"阿姨，姨妈","explanation":"이모：阿姨，姨妈；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71153","senseId":"1","lemma":"이모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한집에","meaning":"一个，同一；家","explanation":"한：一个，同一；집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"},{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73278","senseId":"4","lemma":"한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살고","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"5d1a410b7ca871d4","term":"삼촌","zh":"叔叔，舅舅","audio":"/audio/5d1a410b7ca871d4064c.mp3","entryId":"61142","definition":"用于指称或称呼父母的兄弟。","pronunciation":["삼촌"]},{"id":"dfd6511ae5195e09","term":"이모","zh":"阿姨，姨妈","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3","entryId":"71153","definition":"用于指称或称呼母亲的姐姐或妹妹。","pronunciation":["이모"]},{"id":"89233692031a62c6","term":"한","zh":"一个，同一","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3","entryId":"73278","definition":"同一个。","pronunciation":["한"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a3ed60c64e7968ac19c4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14365-1-7-2","ko":"그럼 대형 주택에 살겠구나.","zh":"那你们住的房子一定很大。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대형","meaning":"大型","explanation":"대형：大型","readings":[{"term":"대형","audio":"/audio/e17d6d9a9050995ee1e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14365","senseId":"1","lemma":"대형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주택에","meaning":"住宅，住房","explanation":"주택：住宅，住房；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주택","audio":"/audio/df006112a473f12b7ed7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62485","senseId":"1","lemma":"주택","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살겠구나.","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"e17d6d9a9050995e","term":"대형","zh":"大型","audio":"/audio/e17d6d9a9050995ee1e4.mp3","entryId":"14365","definition":"在同种事物中，体积或规模属于庞大的。","pronunciation":["대ː형"]},{"id":"df006112a473f12b","term":"주택","zh":"住宅，住房","audio":"/audio/df006112a473f12b7ed7.mp3","entryId":"62485","definition":"供住人的房子。","pronunciation":["주ː택"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d435e5439028c6826798.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.385,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14365","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.2117,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们家和奶奶、爷爷、叔叔、姨妈住在一起。","那你们住的房子一定很大。","怎么这么高兴啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我们家和奶奶、爷爷、叔叔、姨妈住在一起。","那你们住的房子一定很大。","怎么这么高兴啊？"],"answer":1}]}
